# Copy to .env.local for local dev / Android debug builds (never commit secrets).
#
# --- One-time Google Drive OAuth setup (HUMAN) ---
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create or pick a project → enable "Google Drive API" (APIs & Services → Library).
# 3. OAuth consent screen: External, add scope drive.file, add your Google account as test user.
# 4. Credentials → Create credentials → OAuth client ID → Application type: Web application.
# 5. Authorized JavaScript origins (exact):
#      http://localhost:5173
#      capacitor://localhost
#      https://localhost
# 6. Copy the Client ID below (not the client secret — web GIS uses token flow).
# 7. Paste into .env.local, rebuild web + Android APK, reinstall on device.
# 8. On device: Settings (gear) → Google Drive → Sync now → pick Google account → allow Drive access.

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
